{"3504510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vesper and The Umbral Passage", "steam_appid": 3504510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Be part of the community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/88f6e205cde6b49a98899ea59cc71e6e.avif?t=1774196222\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Vesper Vaughn, a bold and agile Desert Mouse cursed with supernatural abilities and armed with a magical staff. Teleport across ancient ruins, leap over treacherous obstacles, and fend off lurking foes in a stylized 3D action-adventure platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff Teleportation</strong> – Aim and throw your enchanted staff to special walls, then instantly warp to its location. Master clever angles and timing to outwit enemies or snag hidden collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/99ebadef1d4a3e3a4b1342e153d22b4d.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/99ebadef1d4a3e3a4b1342e153d22b4d.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/99ebadef1d4a3e3a4b1342e153d22b4d.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile Platforming</strong> – Double-jump, dash, and roll your way through perilous desert landscapes, crumbling ruins, and more. Every new level is packed with secrets to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6ecdde82e92c7b3e974ef4e5d17ddef5.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6ecdde82e92c7b3e974ef4e5d17ddef5.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6ecdde82e92c7b3e974ef4e5d17ddef5.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Exploration</strong> – Uncover the secrets of the Umbral Passage as you solve environmental puzzles and manipulate mirrors, shadows, and mystical relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/21a147132fc26a35f3c56d8daebae0f5.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/21a147132fc26a35f3c56d8daebae0f5.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/21a147132fc26a35f3c56d8daebae0f5.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Art Style</strong> – Immerse yourself in a bold, comic-inspired world packed with colorful vistas and flowing sand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/ce189447488f693830a713174c444186.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/ce189447488f693830a713174c444186.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/ce189447488f693830a713174c444186.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Vesper Vaughn, a bold and agile Desert Mouse cursed with supernatural abilities and armed with a magical staff. Teleport across ancient ruins, leap over treacherous obstacles, and fend off lurking foes in a stylized 3D action-adventure platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff Teleportation</strong> – Aim and throw your enchanted staff to special walls, then instantly warp to its location. Master clever angles and timing to outwit enemies or snag hidden collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/99ebadef1d4a3e3a4b1342e153d22b4d.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/99ebadef1d4a3e3a4b1342e153d22b4d.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/99ebadef1d4a3e3a4b1342e153d22b4d.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile Platforming</strong> – Double-jump, dash, and roll your way through perilous desert landscapes, crumbling ruins, and more. Every new level is packed with secrets to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6ecdde82e92c7b3e974ef4e5d17ddef5.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6ecdde82e92c7b3e974ef4e5d17ddef5.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6ecdde82e92c7b3e974ef4e5d17ddef5.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Exploration</strong> – Uncover the secrets of the Umbral Passage as you solve environmental puzzles and manipulate mirrors, shadows, and mystical relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/21a147132fc26a35f3c56d8daebae0f5.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/21a147132fc26a35f3c56d8daebae0f5.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/21a147132fc26a35f3c56d8daebae0f5.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Art Style</strong> – Immerse yourself in a bold, comic-inspired world packed with colorful vistas and flowing sand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/ce189447488f693830a713174c444186.poster.avif?t=1774196222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/ce189447488f693830a713174c444186.webm?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/ce189447488f693830a713174c444186.mp4?t=1774196222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Vesper the Jerboa embarks on a quest into a foreign dimension, solving ancient puzzles to unlock the secrets of the Umbral Passage, a network of mystical pathways that connects missing worlds. His journey will uncover the truth behind his newfound abilities and the secrets of this new dimension. ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/0087a3b0444a3c5531a350d33f69839c2beed32f/header.jpg?t=1774196222", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/85c5b1834d7c09beaef9e7b79a7263e2f667d17f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774196222", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/85c5b1834d7c09beaef9e7b79a7263e2f667d17f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774196222", "website": "https://emberscope.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP SP3 / Windows Vista / Windows 7 / Windows 8 / Windows 10 64-bit only<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong